# 🎬 Autonomous Faceless YouTube Shorts Automator

An autonomous AI pipeline that generates, composes, and publishes viral vertical 9:16 Shorts directly to YouTube.

This branch expands the concept engine substantially to a 10,000-item bank with far more title templates, environments, and voiceover narratives so the generator can run without repeating itself for a long time.

## Expanded concept bank

- 10,000 unique concepts in the default build output
- expanded title templating system
- larger pool of battle environments and cinematic settings
- much broader voiceover narrative set for more unexpected storytelling
- more varied archetypes and tag combinations for long-running output diversity

## Regenerate the bank

```bash
python build_concepts_bank.py
```

This writes the generated concept set to `assets/concepts_bank.json`.

## Existing project notes

The rest of the Shorts pipeline remains the same; the only major change is the expanded concept generation size and variety.

